			dependencies: ["2500F1C2E3D40002"]
			description: [
				"Three magic-machine steps in sequence: Grand Enchanting Sanctum (Draconium + Elementium + Life Essence, sourceCost 75,000) -> Runic Altar (Gaia Ingot, Wilden Tribute, Wrath and Pride Runes, 50,000 mana) -> Terra Plate (Awakened Draconium, Gaia Ingot, Chaotic Singulite, 15,000,000 mana -- the single largest mana cost in the pack)."
